# Normalise line endings so generated interfaces stay byte-identical across
# platforms. `moon info` always writes LF, so a CRLF checkout (the GitHub
# windows-latest default, core.autocrlf=true) would make pkg.generated.mbti
# look dirty and break the interface-freshness check.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.mbti text eol=lf
*.mbt  text eol=lf
*.pkg  text eol=lf
